  "description": "Avalonia controls for Periphery.Camera. Drop CameraPreview into your XAML and bind it to a DeviceInfo to get a live camera feed with reconnect resilience and zero capture-loop plumbing. Renders BGRA32 and RGBA32 straight into a reused WriteableBitmap, decodes MJPEG through Skia, and converts YUY2 and NV12 in-process.",
